<body>
    <h1>Setup</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>With the IGEL Setup, you can configure your endpoint device. Thi=
s article shows how to configure the starting methods for the IGEL Setup in=
 IGEL OS.&nbsp;</p>
<hr>
<p>Menu path: <strong>Accessories &gt; Setup</strong></p><span class=3D"con=
fluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual=
-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-bor=
der image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"458d4e87719ba6c68f4b3=
09221c2fb03b997664319817bf0dd25dc42a61b2b03" data-image-src=3D"https://igel=
