ould not be found.
</div>
<p>If you configure user types and passwords under <strong>Security &gt; Pa=
ssword</strong>, a login window appears at the start of the IGEL Setup. For=
 more information, see <a href=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/spac=
es/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73302358/Password+and+User+Types+in+IGEL+OS+12" dat=
a-linked-resource-id=3D"73302358" data-linked-resource-version=3D"7" data-l=
inked-resource-type=3D"page">Password and User Types in IGEL OS 12</a> .</p=
>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>If you do not configure the user types and passwords, the IGEL Setup can=
 be opened without password protection.</p>
</div>
</div><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper co=
nfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image conf=
luence-content-image-border image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"6b64bdb52f4c1aedf4f313529721bffe4e3db71629e6a87071c7d60dfa07f2e0" data-=
