 data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resourc=
e-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"73302858"=
 data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"4" data-media-id=3D"6442cba9-cba=
f-4b43-9409-909dcbc416f1" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"399"></span>
<p>-&gt;Select from the configured user types and provide the corresponding=
 password.&nbsp;</p>
<p>The following user types can be configured to access the IGEL Setup:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Administrator</p></li>
<li>
<p>Setup administrator</p></li>
<li>
<p>Setup user</p></li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
